        "signature": "",
        "thinking": "I'm weighing whether to answer this philosophical choice question about Nozick's experience machine with a stated preference. It's a hypothetical about my own values, so I can pick one and give a short reason. I'll go with A, since I care about being connected to reality, to other people, and to what's true.\n\n",
        "type": "thinking"
      },
      {
        "citations": null,
        "text": "A) Stay in my real life\n\nI'd want my relationships to be with real people, and I'd want my accomplishments to affect the actual world. A life I can't tell apart from a simulation, with no way to know it's one, seems to lose something that matters to me, even if every experience felt good.",
        "type": "text"
      }
